{
  "voice": "kokoro_af_bella",
  "engine": "Kokoro-82M",
  "speed": 1.0,
  "pages": {
    "jardim": {
      "src": "/voice/books/cafu/jardim.m4a?v=coach-bella-1",
      "duration": 40.0,
      "scriptSha256": "e3c40f948434a513444572f979b3dcab230508a51ab56a76e346659ae2e0252b",
      "cues": [
        {
          "text": "Football in Jardim Irene",
          "start": 0.0,
          "duration": 2.4
        },
        {
          "text": "Cafu was born in 1970 in S\u00e3o Paulo, Brazil.",
          "start": 2.4,
          "duration": 4.6
        },
        {
          "text": "He was one of six children, and he grew up in Jardim Irene, a poor part of the city.",
          "start": 7.0,
          "duration": 6.025
        },
        {
          "text": "There he played football in the streets.",
          "start": 13.025,
          "duration": 2.6
        },
        {
          "text": "His real name is Marcos, but friends called him Cafu, after a Brazilian winger called Cafuringa.",
          "start": 15.625,
          "duration": 7.225
        },
        {
          "text": "At seven he went to a football school, and he also played futsal.",
          "start": 22.85,
          "duration": 4.75
        },
        {
          "text": "Kick the ball along the street.",
          "start": 27.6,
          "duration": 2.35
        },
        {
          "text": "One day, he would be famous for running up and down the wing.",
          "start": 29.95,
          "duration": 4.175
        },
        {
          "text": "Street games and futsal teach quick feet. Play wherever you can, with whoever you can.",
          "start": 34.125,
          "duration": 5.85
        }
      ]
    },
    "trials": {
      "src": "/voice/books/cafu/trials.m4a?v=coach-bella-1",
      "duration": 33.3,
      "scriptSha256": "a6862d4ff52c0057d2326047505b2aae91ac43223f25d3190717186188e2a9d6",
      "cues": [
        {
          "text": "No, no, no, no, no",
          "start": 0.0,
          "duration": 2.175
        },
        {
          "text": "As a boy, Cafu went to trials at some of Brazil\u2019s biggest clubs.",
          "start": 2.175,
          "duration": 4.85
        },
        {
          "text": "Corinthians said no.",
          "start": 7.025,
          "duration": 2.175
        },
        {
          "text": "Palmeiras said no.",
          "start": 9.2,
          "duration": 2.075
        },
        {
          "text": "Santos said no.",
          "start": 11.275,
          "duration": 2.1
        },
        {
          "text": "Atl\u00e9tico Mineiro and Portuguesa said no too.",
          "start": 13.375,
          "duration": 3.7
        },
        {
          "text": "That is a lot of no.",
          "start": 17.075,
          "duration": 2.0
        },
        {
          "text": "Flip the five cards.",
          "start": 19.075,
          "duration": 2.1
        },
        {
          "text": "Cafu could have given up.",
          "start": 21.175,
          "duration": 2.2
        },
        {
          "text": "Instead, he kept training, and he kept trying.",
          "start": 23.375,
          "duration": 3.45
        },
        {
          "text": "One coach\u2019s no is not the end of your story. Keep practising and keep asking for chances.",
          "start": 26.825,
          "duration": 6.45
        }
      ]
    },
    "yes": {
      "src": "/voice/books/cafu/yes.m4a?v=coach-bella-1",
      "duration": 27.0,
      "scriptSha256": "f2d68642265f42e3eabfeb6345fb39c18061206d967cba3d89a775eea0cba080",
      "cues": [
        {
          "text": "At last, a yes",
          "start": 0.0,
          "duration": 2.075
        },
        {
          "text": "In 1988 his hometown club, S\u00e3o Paulo, said yes.",
          "start": 2.075,
          "duration": 4.575
        },
        {
          "text": "Cafu joined their youth team, and that same year the team won the Copa S\u00e3o Paulo, a famous youth tournament.",
          "start": 6.65,
          "duration": 7.5
        },
        {
          "text": "Open the club gate.",
          "start": 14.15,
          "duration": 1.975
        },
        {
          "text": "After all those trials, the answer was finally yes, and he had a place to grow.",
          "start": 16.125,
          "duration": 5.775
        },
        {
          "text": "When you get your chance, keep working just as hard as when you were waiting for it.",
          "start": 21.9,
          "duration": 5.075
        }
      ]
    },
    "rightback": {
      "src": "/voice/books/cafu/rightback.m4a?v=coach-bella-1",
      "duration": 40.3,
      "scriptSha256": "fdd7cfcf7144c756188e5de7745d91cd59ba7d77f0c228c88839d5acb9db07b6",
      "cues": [
        {
          "text": "A brand-new position",
          "start": 0.0,
          "duration": 2.1
        },
        {
          "text": "Cafu was a right-sided midfielder.",
          "start": 2.1,
          "duration": 2.975
        },
        {
          "text": "His coach, Tel\u00ea Santana, had an idea: move him back to right-back.",
          "start": 5.075,
          "duration": 5.05
        },
        {
          "text": "Cafu had never played there before, but he tried it.",
          "start": 10.125,
          "duration": 3.75
        },
        {
          "text": "It suited him perfectly!",
          "start": 13.875,
          "duration": 2.325
        },
        {
          "text": "He defended, then sprinted forward on the overlap to attack.",
          "start": 16.2,
          "duration": 4.575
        },
        {
          "text": "Run the overlap.",
          "start": 20.775,
          "duration": 1.875
        },
        {
          "text": "With Cafu at right-back, S\u00e3o Paulo won South America\u2019s biggest club competition, the Copa Libertadores, in 1992 and 1993.",
          "start": 22.65,
          "duration": 10.825
        },
        {
          "text": "Try new positions when a coach asks. On the overlap, run outside your winger to give them a pass.",
          "start": 33.475,
          "duration": 6.8
        }
      ]
    },
    "finals": {
      "src": "/voice/books/cafu/finals.m4a?v=coach-bella-1",
      "duration": 35.6,
      "scriptSha256": "8bcfc97057ca14054e89b54a929341f4ca30d66d20e69857a0d7b4605665566a",
      "cues": [
        {
          "text": "Three finals in a row",
          "start": 0.0,
          "duration": 2.175
        },
        {
          "text": "At the 1994 World Cup, Cafu started on the bench.",
          "start": 2.175,
          "duration": 4.65
        },
        {
          "text": "In the final against Italy, a teammate got hurt early.",
          "start": 6.825,
          "duration": 4.175
        },
        {
          "text": "Swap the players.",
          "start": 11.0,
          "duration": 2.025
        },
        {
          "text": "On came Cafu, and Brazil won the World Cup!",
          "start": 13.025,
          "duration": 3.7
        },
        {
          "text": "In 1998 he played in the final again, but this time Brazil lost to France.",
          "start": 16.725,
          "duration": 6.3
        },
        {
          "text": "Four years later, he would play in a third final in a row.",
          "start": 23.025,
          "duration": 4.1
        },
        {
          "text": "No other player has ever done that.",
          "start": 27.125,
          "duration": 2.7
        },
        {
          "text": "Substitutes matter. Be ready from the bench, because your chance can come at any moment.",
          "start": 29.825,
          "duration": 5.75
        }
      ]
    },
    "captain": {
      "src": "/voice/books/cafu/captain.m4a?v=coach-bella-1",
      "duration": 33.3,
      "scriptSha256": "ba2d29672092d6f9344fd26976410141ae98d61785ab976157cc889ad92f7d14",
      "cues": [
        {
          "text": "Captain of Brazil",
          "start": 0.0,
          "duration": 1.975
        },
        {
          "text": "In 2002 Cafu was Brazil\u2019s captain.",
          "start": 1.975,
          "duration": 3.9
        },
        {
          "text": "In the World Cup final, Brazil beat Germany 2\u20130.",
          "start": 5.875,
          "duration": 4.175
        },
        {
          "text": "When Cafu lifted the trophy, his shirt said 100% Jardim Irene, for the place where he grew up.",
          "start": 10.05,
          "duration": 7.15
        },
        {
          "text": "Raise the trophy.",
          "start": 17.2,
          "duration": 1.95
        },
        {
          "text": "Later he started a foundation in Jardim Irene to help children there.",
          "start": 19.15,
          "duration": 5.3
        },
        {
          "text": "He says everything he has, he owes to Jardim Irene.",
          "start": 24.45,
          "duration": 4.25
        },
        {
          "text": "Remember where you started, and help the players coming after you.",
          "start": 28.7,
          "duration": 4.55
        }
      ]
    }
  }
}
